<title>ROMANIA: RUGBY UNION-WALES A BEAT ROMANIA A 42-33.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WALES A BEAT ROMANIA A 42-33.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales A beat Romania A 42-33 (halftime 10-19) in a rugby union representative match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Wales A - Tries: Arwel Thomas, Matthew Back, Neil Watkins, Paul John, Robert Appleyard, Conversions: Thomas (3), Lee Jarvis. Penalties: Thomas (3)</p>
<p>Romania A - Tries: Nicolae Nichitean, Margarit Radoi (2), Valentin Maftei, Vasile Brici. Conversions: Nichitean (4).</p>
</text>
